achievement-fishach_ashockingdemise-name = A shocking demise
achievement-fishach_ashockingdemise-desc = As an Arcfiend, stop at least six hearts using Jolt. It is not cumulative; you must do this within a single round. Jolt costs 200 energy, so you also need to sap at least 1200 (6 x 200) energy. You get this medal at the end of the round, rather than the moment you reach six hearts stopped, so that the OOC medal announcement doesn't expose your presence.
