achievement-fishach_bearhug-desc = Адаптированное условие по мотивам «Bear Hug» (Goonstation).
achievement-fishach_bearhug-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_bettertoburnoutthanfade-name = Better to burn out, than fade away
achievement-fishach_bettertoburnoutthanfade-desc = Complete the Scientist objective and Research Director objective of escaping on the emergency shuttle while on fire with the chemical Silver Sulfadiazine in your system.
achievement-fishach_billmasen-name = Bill Masen
achievement-fishach_billmasen-desc = Complete the Botanist objective of having three mutated plants alive at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_blackandblue-name = Black and Blue
achievement-fishach_blackandblue-desc = As in, your corpse is black and blue. Blue, because you're dead and aren't getting oxygen, and black, because you died with 400 seconds of Burning, at which point the tooltip for the status effects says you're 'extremely on fire'. Dying via the suicide command renders you ineligible for this medal.
achievement-fishach_blockstacker-name = Block Stacker
achievement-fishach_blockstacker-desc = Score 30,000 points on Robustris Pro.
achievement-fishach_bombiniismissing-name = Bombini is Missing!
achievement-fishach_bombiniismissing-desc = Адаптированное условие по мотивам «Bombini is Missing!» (Goonstation).
achievement-fishach_bombiniismissing-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_brownpants-name = Brown Pants
achievement-fishach_brownpants-desc = The medal's icon illustrates it very well: as a Captain, you must successfully insert the authentication disk into the Nuclear Operatives' nuclear bomb. The 'nuke ops' aren't going to let you do that without a fight, so if you want this medal, then follow the medal description and 'show no fear in the face of battle'! You cannot obtain this medal by inserting the auth disk into a micronuke(or its defended variant), even though that bomb also accepts the disk. The admin-spawned 'event nukes' don't work either. Only full-sized ones from the Nuclear Emergency mode count!
achievement-fishach_burythedead-name = Bury the Dead
achievement-fishach_burythedead-desc = Complete the Chaplain objective of having zero corpses on station at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_buttonpusher-name = Button Pusher
achievement-fishach_buttonpusher-desc = Seriously?
achievement-fishach_buttonpusher-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_call1800coder-name = Call 1-800-CODER
achievement-fishach_call1800coder-desc = runtime error: Cannot execute player.unlock_medal() (Cause Goonstation's code to return an error. This does not necessarily mean youвЂ™ll get an error message on your end. However, it does show up on the adminsвЂ™ log of runtimes/errors.)
achievement-fishach_captainslog-name = Captain's Log
achievement-fishach_captainslog-desc = Адаптированное условие по мотивам «Captain's Log» (Goonstation).
achievement-fishach_captainslog-secret = ???
