achievement-fishach_chevalierdusorbet-desc = Deliver the Magma King his Just Desserts
achievement-fishach_chevalierdusorbet-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_contributor-name = Contributor
achievement-fishach_contributor-desc = You cannot get this medal on your own. An admin has to give it to you. This medal is typically bestowed on people who have made major contributions to the game, such as by fixing dozens of bugs or doing lots of re-sprites. As the Goonhub description puts it, thanks <3
achievement-fishach_creamofthecrop-name = Cream of the Crop
achievement-fishach_creamofthecrop-desc = As a Wrestler complete all of your objectives.
achievement-fishach_damned-name = Добровольный финал
achievement-fishach_damned-desc = Die via the suicide command; just enter suicide in the command bar/text parser at the bottom of your screen. The command offers a lot of different ways to die depending on what objects you're holding, what devices you're next to, and whether you're a human, cyborg, etc., and they all make you eligible for the medal, so just pick one you like. Just go through with it; if you use the command but cancel at the prompt, you won't get the medal, so merely entering the command isn't enough.
achievement-fishach_dangerousgame-name = Dangerous Game
achievement-fishach_dangerousgame-desc = As a hunter collect enough a high enough value of skulls to complete your objective.
achievement-fishach_deadoraliveyourecoming-name = Dead or alive, you're coming with me
achievement-fishach_deadoraliveyourecoming-desc = Complete the Security Officer objective or Head of Security objective of having an antagonist in handcuffs on the escape shuttle at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_deepfreeze-name = Deep Freeze
achievement-fishach_deepfreeze-desc = it is absolutely famished...
achievement-fishach_deepfreeze-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_draculajr-name = Dracula Jr.
achievement-fishach_draculajr-desc = As a Vampire accumulate enough blood to complete the'Accumulate at least [number] units of blood in total' objective.
achievement-fishach_dui-name = DUI
achievement-fishach_dui-desc = Driving under the influence while on a MULEBot, specifically. Run someone over with a MULEBot while riding on it and while you have some ethanol in your system. One unit, ten, hundred, doesn't matter how much. This can hurt quite a lot, so if you're not an antagonist, don't do this without a good reason. (If you are an antag, go right ahead.)
achievement-fishach_expendable-name = Expendable
achievement-fishach_expendable-desc = Die as a Revolutionary, specifically a regular one, not a Head Revolutionary. If you died via the suicide verb, it doesn't count towards this medal, but otherwise, it doesn't matter how you go, comrade.
achievement-fishach_felldownthestairs-name = Fell down the stairs
achievement-fishach_felldownthestairs-desc = Die while handcuffed. Again, it doesn't matter how you die, so long as you didn't use the suicide command for it (which is somewhat of a shame since cuffs have a unique suicide.) Having shackles doesn't count for this, but zipties/plastic cuffs and silver handcuffs do, as do regular handcuffs, obviously. Since the code counts them as handcuffs, being duct-taped also works.
achievement-fishach_fish-name = Добро пожаловать за борт
achievement-fishach_fish-desc = Late join into an ongoing round for the first time.
achievement-fishach_foryourohmgood-name = For Your Ohm Good
achievement-fishach_foryourohmgood-desc = Get vaporized by walking into an extremely high-power power transmission laser. The laser needs somewhere in the range of at least 200 Megawatts to gib you.
achievement-fishach_formatcomplete-name = Format Complete
achievement-fishach_formatcomplete-desc = AI, what are your current laws?
achievement-fishach_formatcomplete-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_funtimes-name = Fun Times
achievement-fishach_funtimes-desc = Participate in one of the contests on the forums. These used to be monthly, but now they're enacted on admin discretion. Contests usually last a few weeks, and the admins take care to announce them, so as long as you check back on the forums from time to time, you won't miss out.
achievement-fishach_glassceiling-name = Glass Ceiling
achievement-fishach_glassceiling-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of having a non-assistant ID assigned to you at the end of the round. This ranges from easy to impossible depending on the presence of the Head of Personnel.
achievement-fishach_goawaybatin-name = Go away! 'Batin!
achievement-fishach_goawaybatin-desc = Frito Pendejo, public defender.
achievement-fishach_goawaybatin-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_googone-name = Goo Gone
achievement-fishach_googone-desc = It's Good for the Gander
achievement-fishach_googone-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_goodfeasting-name = Good Feasting
achievement-fishach_goodfeasting-desc = As a werewolf, reach your objective number of victims fed on.
achievement-fishach_gorefest-name = Разборка по косточкам
achievement-fishach_gorefest-desc = Get gibbed. If you're unfamiliar with that term, it means your body basically explodes into a mess of body parts and assorted remains, often due to an explosion. It doesn't necessary have to be human remains; getting gibbed as a cyborg, critter, etc. counts. Unlike many other death-related medals, this one doesn't care if you used the suicide command.
achievement-fishach_guardingnome-name = Guardin' Gnome
achievement-fishach_guardingnome-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of ensuring Gnome Chompski is on the emergency shuttle OR escape on the emergency shuttle as any role with Gnome Chompski in your inventory. Gnome Chompski can be found in hidden locations on several maps. Be careful not to lose sight of him! He teleports when he is out of sight.
achievement-fishach_guerrierdugelato-name = Guerrier Du Gelato
achievement-fishach_guerrierdugelato-desc = Complete Chapter II
achievement-fishach_guerrierdugelato-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_helios-name = Helios
achievement-fishach_helios-desc = Just havin' a good time, chillin' out.
achievement-fishach_helios-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_hesdeadjim-name = He's dead, Jim
achievement-fishach_hesdeadjim-desc = Bones.
achievement-fishach_hesdeadjim-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_highfive-name = High Five!
achievement-fishach_highfive-desc = While there is indeed a high-five emote, you don't earn it via that. Instead, you need to shock someone with stun gloves.
achievement-fishach_highvoltage-name = 220 и точка
achievement-fishach_highvoltage-desc = Get electrocuted in some way; you don't necessarily have to die because of it. The game actually offers quite a few ways to earn this: getting shocked by a wire, an APC, or a door all work as you'd expect, but so does walking into an active singularity engine's containment field, getting zapped by a GuardBuddy with an Elektro-Arc tool module, and getting hit by any of the various Adventure Zone enemies that attack with electricity.
achievement-fishach_honkhonkmotherfu-name = honk HONK mother FU-
achievement-fishach_honkhonkmotherfu-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of wearing at least one piece of Clown clothing at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_humanoidmustnotescape-name = HUMANOID MUST NOT ESCAPE
achievement-fishach_humanoidmustnotescape-desc = Die on the escape shuttle. Doesn't matter how, so long as it wasn't through the suicide command. Since the shuttle is so tightly packed, it's a frequent target for antagonists on a murder spree, so you might earn this medal without even trying to.
achievement-fishach_idontgiveashit-name = I don't give a shit
achievement-fishach_idontgiveashit-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of having your butt by any means at the end of the round. A safe bet for having your butt removed is usually visiting Robotics though they may want it for reasons.
achievement-fishach_ihelped-name = I helped!
achievement-fishach_ihelped-desc = End a round as a Security Assistant.
achievement-fishach_ijustcleanedthat-name = I just cleaned that!
achievement-fishach_ijustcleanedthat-desc = Slip 'n slide.
achievement-fishach_ijustcleanedthat-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_ispy-name = I Spy
achievement-fishach_ispy-desc = I spy with my little eye.
achievement-fishach_ispy-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_icarus-name = Icarus
achievement-fishach_icarus-desc = Flew too close!
achievement-fishach_icarus-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_identitytheft-name = Identity Theft
achievement-fishach_identitytheft-desc = Good thing these are not laminated.
achievement-fishach_identitytheft-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_illuminated-name = Illuminated
achievement-fishach_illuminated-desc = Old-school chemist's club.
achievement-fishach_illuminated-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_imin-name = I'm In
achievement-fishach_imin-desc = Successfully gain superuser access on a TermOS terminal via the su command. The AI, Captain, Cyborgs, Head of Security, and Research Director all spawn with superuser access, and it's possible to spoof it via certain commands.
achievement-fishach_isitreallythattimeagain-name = Is it really that time again?
achievement-fishach_isitreallythattimeagain-desc = Gordon would approve.
achievement-fishach_isitreallythattimeagain-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_itsatrap-name = IT'S A TRAP
achievement-fishach_itsatrap-desc = BANG, bang!
achievement-fishach_itsatrap-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_itsfrickinfreezinginhere-name = It's frickin' freezing in here, Mr. Bigglesworth
achievement-fishach_itsfrickinfreezinginhere-desc = Complete the Medical Doctor objective and Medical Director objective of having the Medical Objects#Cryogenic Healing Pod on and under 225K at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_itsjustafleshwound-name = It's just a flesh wound!
achievement-fishach_itsjustafleshwound-desc = Make it to Central Command (aka, CentCom) with a bullet (or more) embedded in you. The precise type doesn't matter, and you can have multiple bullets lodged in you. Shrapnel doesn't count.
achievement-fishach_itsnotdoortoheaven-name = It's not 'Door to Heaven'
achievement-fishach_itsnotdoortoheaven-desc = Complete the Engineer objective of having at least two functional command teleporters
achievement-fishach_itsnoteasybeinggreen-name = It's not easy being green
achievement-fishach_itsnoteasybeinggreen-desc = Your muscles hurt.
achievement-fishach_itsnoteasybeinggreen-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_itsamemario-name = It'sa me, Mario
achievement-fishach_itsamemario-desc = Адаптированное условие по мотивам «It'sa me, Mario» (Goonstation).
achievement-fishach_itsamemario-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_jimiheselden-name = Jimi Heselden
achievement-fishach_jimiheselden-desc = Ride a segway into outer space/ the sea. A reference to Jimi Heselden, an executive (but not founder or inventor) of Segway, Inc. who famously ran off a cliff while on a Segway. He died as a result of that, but you don't actually need to die to earn this medal, just enter space/sea.
achievement-fishach_law1dontbean-name = Law 1: Don't be an asshat
achievement-fishach_law1dontbean-desc = Asimov's laws were definitely behind, because ol' Isaac did not foresee a robot wearing someone's ass as a hat. As the medal image shows, you need to put a butt on the AI's core unit, which, by default, spawns in the AI Chamber.
achievement-fishach_leavenomanbehind-name = Leave no man behind!
achievement-fishach_leavenomanbehind-desc = The ultimate sacrifice.
achievement-fishach_leavenomanbehind-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_licensedarchaeologist-name = Licensed Archaeologist
achievement-fishach_licensedarchaeologist-desc = Complete the Scientist or Research Director objective of activating 10 artifacts in a single shift.
achievement-fishach_lifeuhfindsaway-name = Life, uh... finds a way
achievement-fishach_lifeuhfindsaway-desc = Complete the Geneticist objective and Medical Director objective of having at least 5 people scanned in the Clone Console. Cloning people does remove them from the list of people scanned, so it would be in good practice to scan anyone that is cloned.
achievement-fishach_lockblock-name = Lock Block
achievement-fishach_lockblock-desc = Made friends with a welder.
achievement-fishach_lockblock-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_manwithascan-name = Man with a Scan
achievement-fishach_manwithascan-desc = Complete the Engineer objective of having 10 or more objects scanned in the ruckingeur kit.
achievement-fishach_manhattanproject-name = Manhattan Project
achievement-fishach_manhattanproject-desc = Successfully destroy the station with a nuclear detonation as a Nuclear Operative
achievement-fishach_manynamesmanyfaces-name = Many names, many faces
achievement-fishach_manynamesmanyfaces-desc = As a Changeling, complete the Changeling objective'Absorb the DNA of at least [absorb_count] more crew members in addition to the one you started with, and escape on the shuttle alive.'
achievement-fishach_masterofunlocking-name = Master of Unlocking
achievement-fishach_masterofunlocking-desc = Performed the steps required to unlock the Good Ending from the solarium riddle.
achievement-fishach_masterofunlocking-secret = ???
achievement-fishach_methisahellofa-name = Meth is a hell of a drug
achievement-fishach_methisahellofa-desc = Complete the Scientist objective and Research Director objective of ending the round with methamphetamine in your system.
achievement-fishach_misclick-name = Мимо лица — в плитку
achievement-fishach_misclick-desc = Pry up a floor tile from some flooring using a crowbar; this is specifically for intact flooring, so you can't get this by removing burnt or broken tiles. The joke is that people fighting with crowbars often miss and target the floor instead of their opponent, accidentally prying floor tiles instead of the other person's face.
achievement-fishach_missioncomplete-name = MISSION COMPLETE
achievement-fishach_missioncomplete-desc = As an Antagonist complete your objectives.
achievement-fishach_monkeyduty-name = Monkey Duty
achievement-fishach_monkeyduty-desc = Complete the 'Keep Monsieur Stirstir brigged but also make sure that he comes to absolutely no harm' Security Officer, Security Assistant, and Head of Security objective. This is quite difficult to do as monkeys tend to use tables to flip into walls and other objects. It would be best to check on Stirstir regularly and make sure they aren't hurt and haven't been taken or murdered by a Traitor.
